{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-platform-distribution","title":"跨平台分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/cross-platform-distribution","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨平台分发\">跨平台分发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设计系统的跨平台分发将令牌和组件从单一数据源部署到 Web（npm）、iOS（CocoaPods / SPM）、Android（Maven / Gradle）、React Native、Flutter、桌面端（Electron / Tauri），以及可选的设计工具（Figma 库）——消费方一行安装命令 + 导入即可使用。Monorepo（Lerna、Turborepo、Nx、pnpm workspace）让多包共享同一源码仓库。版本管理 + 变更日志让消费方追踪更新。分发的核心挑战包括原生二进制构建（iOS / Android）、Web 包体积优化、摇树优化（Tree-shaking）、Storybook 文档托管等。本节详细讲解分发渠道、Monorepo 结构、原生平台打包、包体积优化和文档托管方案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n<th>产物格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Web</td>\n<td>npm / yarn / pnpm</td>\n<td>npm 包（CommonJS / ESM / TS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>CocoaPods、SPM</td>\n<td>Framework / Swift 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>Maven、Gradle</td>\n<td>AAR / 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React Native</td>\n<td>npm</td>\n<td>npm 包（JS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flutter</td>\n<td>pub.dev</td>\n<td>Pub 包（Dart）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桌面端</td>\n<td>Electron / Tauri</td>\n<td>npm + 原生打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Figma</td>\n<td>Figma 库</td>\n<td>Figma 文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单一数据源（令牌包）经各平台构建后进入各自生态的包管理器，供消费方安装：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;单一数据源 packages/tokens&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Web npm 包&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;iOS SPM 包&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;Android Maven 库&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;消费方安装导入&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[\"单一数据源 packages/tokens\"] --&gt; B[\"Web npm 包\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"iOS SPM 包\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"Android Maven 库\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"消费方安装导入\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"web-分发\">Web 分发</h2><p><strong>npm 包配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@company/design-system&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;dist/index.cjs.js&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;dist/index.esm.js&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.esm.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./tokens&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/tokens.esm.js&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./styles&quot;: &quot;./dist/styles.css&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@company/design-system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/index.cjs.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/index.esm.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.esm.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/tokens.esm.js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./styles\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/styles.css\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>构建工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rollup、tsup、Vite。</li>\n<li>输出 ESM + CJS + 类型声明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>摇树优化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用具名导出。</li>\n<li>在 package.json 中标记 <code>sideEffects: false</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>消费方使用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { Button } from &#39;@company/design-system&#39;;&#10;import { tokens } from &#39;@company/design-system/tokens&#39;;&#10;import &#39;@company/design-system/styles&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Button } from '@company/design-system';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { tokens } from '@company/design-system/tokens';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import '@company/design-system/styles';</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-分发\">iOS 分发</h2><p><strong>Swift Package Manager（SPM）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Package.swift&#10;let package = Package(&#10;    name: &quot;DesignSystem&quot;,&#10;    products: [&#10;        .library(name: &quot;DesignSystem&quot;, targets: [&quot;DesignSystem&quot;]),&#10;    ],&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .target(name: &quot;DesignSystem&quot;),&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Package.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DesignSystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">library</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DesignSystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DesignSystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DesignSystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CocoaPods</strong>（较旧但仍常见）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ruby\" data-code=\"# DesignSystem.podspec&#10;Pod::Spec.new do |s|&#10;  s.name = &#39;DesignSystem&#39;&#10;  s.version = &#39;1.0.0&#39;&#10;  s.source_files = &#39;Sources/**/*.swift&#39;&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DesignSystem.podspec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Pod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> |s|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DesignSystem'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1.0.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">source_files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Sources/**/*.swift'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>消费方使用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import DesignSystem&#10;&#10;let button = DesignSystem.Button()&#10;let primary = DesignSystem.Tokens.colorActionPrimary\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DesignSystem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> button </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DesignSystem.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> primary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DesignSystem.Tokens.colorActionPrimary</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"android-分发\">Android 分发</h2><p><strong>Maven Central / GitHub Packages</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle&#10;publishing {&#10;    publications {&#10;        release(MavenPublication) {&#10;            groupId = &#39;com.company&#39;&#10;            artifactId = &#39;design-system&#39;&#10;            version = &#39;1.0.0&#39;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>publishing {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    publications {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release(MavenPublication) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            groupId = 'com.company'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            artifactId = 'design-system'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            version = '1.0.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>消费方使用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"implementation &#39;com.company:design-system:1.0.0&#39;&#10;&#10;import com.company.designsystem.Button&#10;import com.company.designsystem.Tokens\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>implementation 'com.company:design-system:1.0.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import com.company.designsystem.Button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import com.company.designsystem.Tokens</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"monorepo-结构\">Monorepo 结构</h2><p><strong>多包单仓库</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"design-system/&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── tokens/           # Style Dictionary 数据源&#10;│   ├── react/            # React 组件（npm）&#10;│   ├── ios/              # Swift 包&#10;│   ├── android/          # Kotlin 库&#10;│   ├── react-native/     # React Native 包&#10;│   └── docs/             # Storybook + 文档站&#10;├── tools/&#10;│   ├── token-build/      # 构建脚本&#10;│   └── component-cli/    # 组件脚手架&#10;├── package.json          # 工作区根配置&#10;└── pnpm-workspace.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>design-system/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── tokens/           # Style Dictionary 数据源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── react/            # React 组件（npm）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ios/              # Swift 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── android/          # Kotlin 库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── react-native/     # React Native 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── docs/             # Storybook + 文档站</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tools/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── token-build/      # 构建脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── component-cli/    # 组件脚手架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json          # 工作区根配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单一数据源。</li>\n<li>跨平台原子化变更。</li>\n<li>协调更方便。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>工具选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pnpm workspace（轻量）。</li>\n<li>Lerna（经典）。</li>\n<li>Turborepo（构建快速）。</li>\n<li>Nx（功能丰富）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"版本策略\">版本策略</h2><p><strong>独立版本管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个包独立管理版本号。</li>\n<li>React 组件 1.5.0 和 iOS 包 2.0.0 并存。</li>\n<li>灵活但可能让消费方困惑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>固定版本管理</strong>（Lerna 固定模式）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有包使用相同版本号。</li>\n<li>每次发布全部升级。</li>\n<li>简单但可能产生不必要的频繁升级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混合方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>令牌和组件使用固定版本。</li>\n<li>工具链使用独立版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>成熟项目使用独立版本。</li>\n<li>早期项目使用固定版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"构建流水线\">构建流水线</h2><p><strong>Web 平台</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 构建令牌&#10;npm run build:tokens&#10;&#10;# 2. 构建组件&#10;npm run build:web&#10;&#10;# 3. 生成类型声明&#10;tsc --emitDeclarationOnly&#10;&#10;# 4. 打包 CSS&#10;postcss src/styles.css -o dist/styles.css&#10;&#10;# 5. 运行测试&#10;npm test&#10;&#10;# 6. 发布&#10;npm publish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 构建令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build:tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 构建组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build:web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 生成类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --emitDeclarationOnly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 打包 CSS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postcss</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/styles.css</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/styles.css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5. 运行测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 6. 发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多平台并行构建</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在持续集成中并行构建所有平台。</li>\n<li>统一发布。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"持续集成与持续交付\">持续集成与持续交付</h2><p><strong>合并到主分支时</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/release.yml&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: 构建所有平台&#10;        run: npm run build:all&#10;&#10;      - name: 运行测试&#10;        run: npm run test:all&#10;&#10;      - name: 视觉回归测试&#10;        run: npm run chromatic&#10;&#10;      - name: 发布 npm 包&#10;        run: npm publish --access public&#10;        env:&#10;          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;      - name: 发布 iOS 包&#10;        run: ./scripts/publish-ios.sh&#10;&#10;      - name: 发布 Android 包&#10;        run: ./scripts/publish-android.sh&#10;&#10;      - name: 部署文档&#10;        run: npm run deploy:docs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/release.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">构建所有平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run build:all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">运行测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run test:all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">视觉回归测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run chromatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">发布 npm 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm publish --access public</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">发布 iOS 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./scripts/publish-ios.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">发布 Android 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./scripts/publish-android.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">部署文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run deploy:docs</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>发布工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>changesets（npm 生态主流）。</li>\n<li>semantic-release（自动化）。</li>\n<li>手动发布 + Git 标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"包体积优化\">包体积优化</h2><p><strong>摇树优化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用具名导出。</li>\n<li>标记 <code>sideEffects: false</code>。</li>\n<li>用包分析器验证效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CSS 优化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移除未使用的 CSS。</li>\n<li>使用 PurgeCSS。</li>\n<li>或采用原子化 CSS（如 Tailwind）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>代码分割</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消费方仅导入使用的部分。</li>\n<li>组件级别拆分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>包分析工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>webpack-bundle-analyzer。</li>\n<li>Rollup visualizer。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"storybook-托管\">Storybook 托管</h2><p><strong>Storybook</strong> 是组件展示和文档的工具。</p>\n<p><strong>托管方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chromatic（商业方案，体验最佳）。</li>\n<li>Netlify。</li>\n<li>Vercel。</li>\n<li>GitHub Pages。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>公开 vs 私有</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源项目使用公开 Storybook。</li>\n<li>内部项目使用认证保护。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>每次 PR 预览</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个合并请求部署预览版 Storybook。</li>\n<li>设计师和工程师可直接审查。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"文档站点\">文档站点</h2><p><strong>静态站点方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Docusaurus。</li>\n<li>Nextra。</li>\n<li>VitePress。</li>\n<li>基于 MDX。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>组件展示 + 代码</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实时交互式预览。</li>\n<li>可复制粘贴的代码。</li>\n<li>展示各种变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>无障碍文档</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个组件标注无障碍说明。</li>\n<li>ARIA 属性说明。</li>\n<li>键盘操作支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>商业方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Zeroheight：整合设计与代码文档。</li>\n<li>Knapsack：类似方案。</li>\n<li>自建（Docusaurus + Storybook）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"各平台文档\">各平台文档</h2><p><strong>Web 平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>React 组件使用方式。</li>\n<li>CSS 类名。</li>\n<li>令牌使用方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>iOS 平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Swift Package 使用方式。</li>\n<li>SwiftUI 与 UIKit 示例。</li>\n<li>令牌 Swift 常量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Android 平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kotlin / Compose 使用方式。</li>\n<li>令牌 XML / Compose 代码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>跨平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相同的组件设计。</li>\n<li>各平台不同的代码实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"迁移辅助\">迁移辅助</h2><p><strong>自动代码迁移工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>破坏性变更时自动更新消费方代码。</li>\n<li>jscodeshift（JavaScript）。</li>\n<li>ast-grep（通用语法树搜索）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>迁移指南</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无法自动迁移部分的手动说明。</li>\n<li>例如：API 重命名步骤。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cdn-分发\">CDN 分发</h2><p><strong>unpkg / jsDelivr</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;https://unpkg.com/@company/design-system/dist/styles.css&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;script type=&quot;module&quot;&gt;&#10;  import { Button } from &#39;https://unpkg.com/@company/design-system?module&#39;;&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stylesheet\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://unpkg.com/@company/design-system/dist/styles.css\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'https://unpkg.com/@company/design-system?module'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>快速原型开发。</li>\n<li>无构建流水线的项目。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无法摇树优化。</li>\n<li>依赖网络。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 所有平台打成一个包</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>React + iOS + Android 放在一个 npm 包里。</li>\n<li>行不通。</li>\n<li>应拆分为独立包。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不使用 Monorepo</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多仓库 + 手动同步。</li>\n<li>容易偏移不一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做版本管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消费方无法感知变更。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 包体积过大</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1MB 的 CSS 文件。</li>\n<li>应使用摇树优化 + PurgeCSS。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 公开 Storybook 包含内部信息</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>泄露商业机密。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 不测试消费方使用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发布前不验证消费方体验。</li>\n<li>导致消费方报错。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 从一开始就使用 Monorepo</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pnpm + Turborepo。</li>\n<li>持续集成更快。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 各平台独立版本管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Web 更新频繁。</li>\n<li>iOS 更新较少。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 自动化发布</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 changesets 或 semantic-release。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. Storybook 必不可少</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>组件展示 + 文档一体化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 提供迁移辅助工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>破坏性变更时提供自动代码迁移。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 测试消费方使用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用示例应用做端到端测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>跨平台分发将设计系统部署到 Web（npm）、iOS（SPM/CocoaPods）、Android（Maven/Gradle）、React Native（npm）、Flutter（pub）、桌面端（Electron/Tauri）和 Figma 库。Monorepo（pnpm workspace + Turborepo / Lerna / Nx）让多包单仓库实现原子化变更和高效协调。Web npm 包输出多格式（CommonJS + ESM + 类型声明）+ exports 字段 + 摇树优化 sideEffects: false，消费方使用具名导入。iOS 使用 SPM（Package.swift）或 CocoaPods（Pod::Spec），消费方 <code>import DesignSystem</code>。Android 通过 Maven 发布 groupId/artifactId/version，消费方 <code>implementation &#39;com.company:design-system:1.0.0&#39;</code>。版本策略有独立版本（各包独立）vs 固定版本（全部同步）vs 混合模式，成熟项目用独立、早期项目用固定。构建流水线为令牌 → 组件 → 类型 → CSS → 测试 → 发布。持续集成在合并到主分支时构建所有平台 + 测试 + 视觉回归 + 多平台发布 + 文档部署，工具选择 changesets 或 semantic-release。包体积优化包括摇树 + 具名导出 + sideEffects:false + 包分析器 + CSS 清理 + 代码分割。Storybook 托管方案有 Chromatic / Netlify / Vercel / GitHub Pages，支持每次 PR 预览。文档站点推荐 Docusaurus / Nextra / VitePress + Storybook + 商业方案 Zeroheight。各平台分别提供 Web React / iOS Swift / Android Kotlin Compose 的使用示例。迁移辅助工具 jscodeshift / ast-grep + 迁移指南。CDN 分发通过 unpkg / jsDelivr 适合快速原型但无法摇树。应避免的反模式包括：所有平台打一个包、不用 Monorepo、不做版本管理、包体积过大、泄露内部信息、不测试消费方。建议从一开始就用 Monorepo + 各平台独立版本 + 自动发布 + Storybook + 迁移辅助 + 消费方测试。跨平台分发是设计系统实战的&quot;最后一公里&quot;——做对了让消费方一行安装即用，做不对让设计系统沦为内部孤岛。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨平台分发","id":"跨平台分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Web 分发","id":"web-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 分发","id":"ios-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 分发","id":"android-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 结构","id":"monorepo-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"版本策略","id":"版本策略"},{"level":2,"text":"构建流水线","id":"构建流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"持续集成与持续交付","id":"持续集成与持续交付"},{"level":2,"text":"包体积优化","id":"包体积优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Storybook 托管","id":"storybook-托管"},{"level":2,"text":"文档站点","id":"文档站点"},{"level":2,"text":"各平台文档","id":"各平台文档"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移辅助","id":"迁移辅助"},{"level":2,"text":"CDN 分发","id":"cdn-分发"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Figma 令牌与同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/figma-tokens-and-sync"},"next":{"title":"版本管理与变更日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/versioning-and-changelog"}}